Z||000008||Dragon||09-25-2001||01:08 AM||||I never figured out how to put up pictures but did put a couple up on a small site<BR> <A HREF="http://SpaceCoastFieros.com/photos/rfth6" TARGET=_blank>http://SpaceCoastFieros.com/photos/rfth6</A> <P>Having been there for all six runs I have to admit this has been one of the best.  David and Kimberly deserve many thanks for a job well done<P>Dragon<BR>||||reg||14
